<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - International Multifoods.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - International Multifoods.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it upgraded International Multifoods Corp to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- A Piper Jaffray report cited &quot;confidence the company's future is considerably brighter with the new management team now in place.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Put a 12-month price target of $28 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 20-1/2.</p>
</text>
